@hjdd14/dsh-toolong-warning README · compaction lifecycle — never message content.：**`moduleGeneration` is load-bearing.** Host-side changes only load in a new `dsh web` process — dsh
hot-reloads client bundles only. The generation counter exists so the running process can report
which code it is serving, rather than that being a matter of inference.
